# hypercluster core

- Config: single `cluster.conf` (template `config/cluster.conf.example`).
- k3s platform: Cilium before cert-manager; `K3S_EXEC_ARGS` includes `--disable-kube-proxy`.
- Re-deploy skips healthy k3s reinstall unless `FORCE_K3S_REINSTALL=1`.
- `test --json` / `status --json`: stdout JSON only; human output on stderr.
- Desktop lifecycle ops spawn `hypercluster` only — never direct helm/kubectl.
- After CLI/config changes run `make docs`. After shell changes run `make lint`.
- See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agents/training.md`.
